  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Social Protection in Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the investment is to provide support on social protection related activities to GIZ&apos;s Improving Social Protection and Health (ISPH) project. The three social protection related outputs of ISPH are: 
1)	The strategic framework for the ongoing development of the social protection system has been improved.
2)	The social protection system is better equipped to take account of the needs of vulnerable groups.
3)	The implementation capacities of social protection operators have been strengthened.</narrative>
  </description>
